iversity wrestling team begins dual action with a match against Mercyhurst at Cameron High School in Cameron, W.Va., at 7 p.m. on Saturday.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/6/WRESTLE26_MATCHUP_vs.MERCYHURST_1920x1080.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/6/WRESTLE26_MATCHUP_vs.MERCYHURST_1920x1080.jpg"><media:title>The No. 23 West Virginia University wrestling team begins dual action with a match against Mercyhurst at Cameron High School in Cameron, W.Va., at 7 p.m. on Saturday. </media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/6/WRESTLE26_MATCHUP_vs.MERCYHURST_1920x1080.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:42:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>18</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59653</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mawer, Ishii, Stratford Highlight All-Sun Belt Honors</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/6/mens-soccer-mawer-ishii-stratford-highlight-all-sun-belt-honors</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/6/mens-soccer-mawer-ishii-stratford-highlight-all-sun-belt-honors</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Mawer, Ishii, Stratford are featured as Sun Belt award winners" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/6/Untitled-1All_Sun_Belt.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – Redshirt sophomore Toby Mawer was named Sun Belt Goalkeeper of the Year, junior Kanta Ishii earned Newcomer of the Year, and head coach Dan Stratford was named Coach of the Year to highlight the Sun Belt Conference postseason awards for the West Virginia University men's soccer team, as announced by the conference on Friday.]]></description><m